# The six raw shoot sets the floor numbers were read off are 11MB of
# full-page PNGs and they are not committed, because the charter asks for
# a light repository. L41's rule is why they are not compressed and
# committed instead: any frame set a tool reads a number off is committed
# uncompressed or not at all, since quantisation moves exactly the counts
# a subtle frame is evidence for. `frames/` is one set, quantised, for the
# eye. `data/floor-after.txt` is the number, read off the raw sets in the
# sandbox before any of this ran.
after/
